title: "Anthropic PBC"   # working title — set your own
type: report
abstract: >-
  A working paper offering a governance-focused counterpoint to Anthropic's
  2026 Public Benefit Report, read alongside its S-1 and Constitution. It
  describes a verifiable-claims approach and a protocol for attributed
  endorsements and disputes, presented for public contest. Byte-exact quotation
  checks establish textual occurrence, not by themselves the truth or semantic
  support of every claim. This DOI identifies the archived v0 edition;
  later repository work is not part of that published snapshot.
